": "2501291936789025", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12331303_245598725994458_479181173273133056_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l0o6g4F8Cl0Q7kNvwEZtiRt&_nc_oc=AdqvSw8YyayiTxoiS0bVsgVYahsGogZL2ouy2G3VXcE91BBNt36m1mB7GLhKcKT1MTA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9Gi4T_O-JjNocgJoZYcZ3ViIcUwSBlGILmGaTjnVWYnA&oe=6A4686FD"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "642658059801509", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139433_425044671239926_4609888145117282304_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-HFC03u0FCwQ7kNvwGFKILF&_nc_oc=AdrvltYiJJtvizHHPZ4PVwL9UZcAnZ6FDiB5Ew5RMlaxrn_H-wXVrinf8EJLvelkSxk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8x6c8l4kjO9YVCiD9WbuEaYu6GnNKpf-yJXByQlCb1ww&oe=6A466D3B"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "619740281913536", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139467_430682997415049_6349888944162734080_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y3rxtkjX-lcQ7kNvwG4wfBy&_nc_oc=AdrqFjRmpQ77bgXcN3936YjAzjKV-cDccfEpu2QEUvsIpmgzZ0n1DMQ5iOeo4PXEQ5U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8CyXKRDtB7YPkx3qBLUAr3NQdRRZgGYPkDqhpy54kzXQ&oe=6A468265"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "RotatorX", "keywords": ["Arcade", "Endlessrunner", "SciFi", "Speed", "Fast"], "long_description": "RotatorX is an endless runner type arcade game with a dark unique sci-fi atmosphere. Fast paced and addictive - but also meditative. The intuitive controls makes it easy to play - but it's hard to gain. Speed, procedural level design, dynamic lighting FX and an adaptive soundtrack will guarantee a challenging and immersive VR experience.\n\nKEY FEATURES\n* Dynamic lighting FX\n* Adaptive soundtrack\n* Intuitve controls\n* Procedural level design\n\n! Oculus Go only !", "short_description": "RotatorX is an endless runner type arcade g